message: "If you use this code, please cite the manuscript and the Zenodo archives below."
title: "HPICDA — Human Pulmonary Infection Conditional Dependency Atlas (analysis code)"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a baseline-fitness-aware re-analysis of 39 CRISPR
  loss-of-function screens of human respiratory infection and an independent
  holdout adjudication of the candidate set it produces.
type: software
authors:
